===Etymology 2===
An ellipsis of "Please come back for another visit"

====Verb====
{{head|en|verb|head=[[come]] [[again]]}}

# {{context|idiomatic|lang=en}} {{non-gloss definition|Used as a polite farewell to a visitor, inviting a return visit.}}

=====Usage notes=====
* Often used in retail stores and service establishments, especially in hotels and restaurants

